## Contributing

Issues and pull requests are welcome. Commit subjects follow Conventional Commits, because
release-please reads them to raise the release pull request and to write both CHANGELOGs, so the
type you write decides the version bump.

`./gradlew clean test :catalog:jar` is what CI runs on a pull request. A new recipe needs a test
class beside it: `RewriteTest` compares the source before and after, which is the only check that a
visitor does what its description claims.

